    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/b4fc80561367ab605fc7fc61257097e8.avif?t=1749426292\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community <strong>Discord</strong> to engage with us during the development process! We'll also announce <strong>playtests</strong> and <strong>latest news</strong> here!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to <strong>WISHLIST</strong>\u00a0on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fat Goblins</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breach the walls and rescue your pudgy princess from the clutches of the enemy castle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/a5cbfbafd46b111b86d6b7b200a80ea4.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatten up your captive royal with delicious meat you scavenge from your teammates &amp; enemies corpses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/1cef2b28f00e1410b4bec8ff001c4266.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win games to upgrade your runes and create the best hat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/31be38d789961cf0beb71a5a15b82c6c.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine abilities with teammates to create powerful combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/860e723caeaf740a5cd43dc237846495.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to <strong>WISHLIST</strong>\u00a0on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fat Goblins</strong>, where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based combat with up to 32 friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/6f6101ec19814718ab3bbfaaf768cecc.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.poster.avif?t=1749426292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.webm?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450350/extras/545221ac86d97301f7918b6f6a7944e0.mp4?t=1749426292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr