    "short_description": "Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team based 16v16 combat! Siege the castle walls, rescue your pudgy princess, fatten up the enemy princess with delicious meat, unlock new hats &amp; weapons, and kill each other repeatedly in silly and chaotic PvP war!",
